sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as Reader
  participant V as Viewer
  participant W as Preview worker
  participant D as Document store
  R->>V: Open document
  V->>D: Read content
  D-->>V: Markdown and metadata
  V->>W: Prepare preview
  W->>W: Parse diagram blocks
  W-->>V: Rendered diagrams
  V-->>R: Show document
  Note over R,V: Explore without changing the source
  R->>V: Open fullscreen
  V->>V: Fit diagram to viewport
  loop While exploring
    R->>V: Pan or zoom
    V-->>R: Update viewport
  end
  R->>V: Close fullscreen
  V-->>R: Restore reading position
